{
  "id": "compressed_air_receivers",
  "title": "Compressed Air Receivers",
  "description": "Calculator and reference tool for sizing compressed air receivers. Calculates receiver tank volume based on air consumption, pressure differential, and time requirements. Includes a reference table of standard receiver capacities.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Air Receiver Sizing Calculator\n\nCalculate the required volume of a compressed air receiver tank based on:\n- Free air needed (C) in SCFM\n- Maximum tank pressure (p1) in psia\n- Minimum tank pressure (p2) in psia\n- Time for pressure drop (t) in seconds\n\nUses the formula: **V = t × C × pa / (p1 - p2)**\n\nWhere pa = atmospheric pressure (14.7 psia)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "air_consumption",
          "label": "Free Air Needed (SCFM)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1000,
          "unit": "cfm"
        },
        {
          "id": "max_pressure",
          "label": "Maximum Tank Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 110,
          "unit": "psig"
        },
        {
          "id": "min_pressure",
          "label": "Minimum Tank Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "psig"
        },
        {
          "id": "time_seconds",
          "label": "Time for Pressure Drop",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5,
          "unit": "seconds"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "tank_volume",
          "label": "Required Tank Volume",
          "formula": "inputs.time_seconds * (1/60) * inputs.air_consumption * 14.7 / (inputs.max_pressure - inputs.min_pressure)",
          "unit": "cubic feet",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "tank_volume_gallons",
          "label": "Required Tank Volume",
          "formula": "inputs.time_seconds * (1/60) * inputs.air_consumption * 14.7 / (inputs.max_pressure - inputs.min_pressure) * 7.48",
          "unit": "gallons",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_band",
          "label": "Pressure Band (Storage)",
          "formula": "inputs.max_pressure - inputs.min_pressure",
          "unit": "psig",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Standard Sizing Rules\n\n- **1 gallon per ACFM** - Quick rule for general applications\n- **4 gallons per compressor HP** - Alternative sizing based on motor horsepower\n\n## Air Receiver Standard Capacities Reference"
    },
    {
